        "title": "SOMEF: Software metadata extraction framework",
        "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22943101",
        "publication_date": "2026-09-24",
        "description": "<p>This release includes minor bug fixes when detecting bibliographic metadata, duplicate headers, and extraction of requirements aligned with CodeMeta. It also attempts to extract a feature list from tools (supported by schema.org).</p>\n<p>Security issues are also updates.</p>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>new Features - featureList category. Fix duplicate headers. Fixes #303, Fixes #1096 by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1098</li>\n<li>checked test with ntlk 3.10.3 by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1099</li>\n<li>Bump click from 8.4.2 to 8.5.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1101</li>\n<li>wrong name in referencePublication. Fixes #1102 by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1106</li>\n<li>Small fix for reference publication title extraction by @dgarijo in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1107</li>\n<li>improve requirements codemeta by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1109</li>\n<li>Bump lxml from 6.1.2 to 6.1.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1112</li>\n<li>improve credit text. AVoid dup results. Better enrichment. Fixes #1105 by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1113</li>\n<li>small instruction about nltk by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1114</li>\n<li>better explanation about nltk by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1116</li>\n<li>depedency resolver. Fixes #1104 by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1117</li>\n<li>bad ubuntu extraction. Fixes #1103 by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1118</li>\n<li>Bump matplotlib from 3.11.1 to 3.11.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1119</li>\n<li>updated bibtexparser. Some changes required by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1122</li>\n<li>Update master with changes for 0.11.4. by @juanjemdIos in https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/pull/1123</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: https://github.com/KnowledgeCaptureAndDiscovery/somef/compare/0.11.3...0.11.4</p>",
